- You don't need heavy native modules (Bluetooth, complex video, etc.). If you do, we may need to drop Expo Go and use dev builds (still doable, just more setup).
- You're okay running on managed infra (Supabase) vs. building a custom backend. Saves weeks.
- Solo or small team. If you're 10+ engineers, I'd reconsider some choices.

